 },
 "deviations_from_design": [
  "ideal_keymatch built in U6 (module PqxdhDeploymentIdealKeymatch) rather than U4; conclusion marks.isSome",
  "the CE decision is rewritten on the whole game to decision-and-mark (game_marked); ideal_cut and ideal_prefix are re-proved for that decision (ideal_cutMarked, ideal_prefixMarked) because PqxdhDeploymentIdealCut is published",
  "CutRelIndexed beside the frozen CutRel carries the owner-entry index and the remaining creations",
  "U6 is published in more modules than designed (PqxdhDeploymentIdealKeymatch, PqxdhDeploymentIdealBranch, PqxdhDeploymentIdealActive, all registered); PqxdhDeploymentIdealPost and PqxdhDeploymentIdealCompile remain",
  "intermediate results are reductions from explicit obligations (SelectedBranch, ActiveBranch, Prop definitions), not assumptions",
  "the steps before encapsulation are compared at the program level for any seed (no static DH request)"
 ],
